{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:e3b6304f56e20142af847b60eb087c50d3a9b8dcc7d4937fc3c49e76b470ed0c",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:94f081bc2dd1e97a577092aa50cce669be0ff8460791aa84ea76d54eb022ed1e",
      "text": "开始转动的三根指针",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:67ab2e495716d29bafd74ccb2d0793add6a5f00a31e740943ee3698fd8a3437b",
      "text": "参加试镜的想乐和克里斯。制作人确信了两人作为偶像的魅力，然而在会场上，却没有看到此前遇到的雨彦的身影。这时克里斯等人，出人意料地讲起了一件奇妙的事情……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_a:cmd-000014:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:851f32e78985f5b441d8d086b8782f09b00f4cc9633468b884231e293ac344f8",
      "text": "第4话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_a:cmd-000014:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:94f081bc2dd1e97a577092aa50cce669be0ff8460791aa84ea76d54eb022ed1e",
      "text": "开始转动的三根指针",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_a:cmd-000016:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:57435e1ed9e97502264f08d2528869e5fb9c4cd98772fe1080622031f43ce149",
      "text": "数分钟前……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_a:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c348f6f2d43ec62f4333ef4e39c5cfcfbad025161910e49922ec129a584a0f79",
      "text": "……启程赴艺途，其中尽是甘与苦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_a:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1803fe5687105dea41aefdef6e868e7a96f705212f44b2deca880896d3c5cd76",
      "text": "（终于到了试镜当天啊～。还有一点\n时间，复习一下收到的资料吧……啊）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_a:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cc18549225fbece14ffaf519e73bfe60fda81e435a15b28514d4a7324a2db68b",
      "text": "请。……哎呀？这份资料是……您也是\n来参加今天的试镜的吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_a:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c41bf829a749934eef9f8c1feb97c5e52dd4da3700ce86df70e0e18517e4de1f",
      "text": "谢谢你～\n是的，没错哦～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_a:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f807069eaa6a67f41252200bfc6c5c60e8f4f4417c9947bc0d36c7a9c1bfb130",
      "text": "（……“您也是”也就是说……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_a:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:974b3ef1b7047d9bb8814ff231bd41696db144e77915f3c18641c2d3d794287b",
      "text": "（这个人也是试镜的参加者啊～。\n长相相当标致呢，说不定是个强敌～？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_a:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:63462962b8932aa25b2bc7233f844b394a5779d4fb6e4920aaf7cb1040e424c7",
      "text": "莫非，您在紧张吗？我也一样呢。\n如果可以的话，要不要闲聊几句一起放松一下？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_a:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0dac7ed506dbdbebc689f694bd3e821700669095f073bdc1de16ba681de6f8c7",
      "text": "好啊，请……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_a:cmd-000094:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f0a19388a792d31f11e7f0490682adcb473e85c1eefca9bb1592e57777572e0b",
      "text": "谈话主题就定为……对了！\n聊聊彼此“深爱之物”，意下如何？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_a:cmd-000097:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8bfec7e0b9e7639164f97a37ec0fc58fd555121bdd6f49f51db8c749064a91b6",
      "text": "……“深爱之物”，是吗～？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_a:cmd-000102:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ee656b65c16489d8366b0de0fb67c9ff32844f2c8c5d008f1bad43fc131fc2bc",
      "text": "是的！那么首先，\n就由先提出来的我开始说起吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_a:cmd-000108:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f7199f320579aac1d5f975f2a3e336e0bd921a6106466837e608202373c54c87",
      "text": "我献上坚定不移的爱之物……那就是，大海！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_b:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:08188732fa542fe9e68b650f3697a60caace8ef559f4ff6631d69736adef42f8",
      "text": "啊，如果此时此刻能够感受到大海的雄伟，\n想必，我们的紧张感也能平静下来吧……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_b:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:45fc96844aa2518551db3b2870e14af1dccd0d548a7bff8f4e138a878f33bb69",
      "text": "您不也是这么认为的吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_b:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e60059fc25197f4784f5986c26e910123a533f121c6db5079ae017eb0ee38b76",
      "text": "（说是强敌……不如说，是个怪人吧～）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_b:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a5386e6330a4ac69058ab075cd1e2367eddf1241e24952b33a13634dbbdfa859",
      "text": "各位，让你们久等了！\n接下来带大家前往试镜会场。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_b:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:607bcad3e58922ab3aafffda38c6c622f45bbd70b5bd891da3699dfa2f0fa8ed",
      "text": "请各位参加者移步。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_b:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6a582f96b41ccefbde0d3ac2f23930f735987da8033215894f055b2b1383bdf0",
      "text": "古论克里斯先生、北村想乐先生，对吧。\n今天请多多指教！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_b:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4696e084cc9377e64e3bb4c2f8853757cb6890eed0735e572e8ee231722c420d",
      "text": "那么，首先请做自我介绍。\n请古论克里斯先生先来。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_b:cmd-000092:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8b433b4db222a1262dc66ded1a473c7d9afcf174995e88791cd01ad215b69884",
      "text": "好的。我叫古论克里斯。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_b:cmd-000096:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9c857d8b43dacc6dfe3fb94464baef1c9c2fb559cea4bfef205051f9366cddc0",
      "text": "在大学担任海洋学的助理教授，\n一直向学生们传达着所深爱的大海的魅力。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_b:cmd-000100:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7acd7e65cd314c99a71ff9e9d65cc85986d1eef86f807de39ac2211c861cbcfa",
      "text": "大海的魅力这种东西，说起来是无穷无尽的。\n但是，如果要重新介绍的话……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_c:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4dff9f2ee64c04f82374428f0dd6aec579e0111a9adce10c29ba9afa13c92eaf",
      "text": "……总而言之，大海拥有着接纳\n我们好奇心的，深邃的魅力！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_c:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6327bbfa4fdcb28fc7cd2295fb63b8d2be634ce307f9bafa1ba12c615e9979da",
      "text": "……是的，无论我讲了多少次课，\n都无法引起学生们的兴趣。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_c:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ab6c18c21e57afd5b7af2dd0a6c13a093ffa6de8280e9775107f5607b8488a97",
      "text": "但是，如果借助偶像这个全新的世界、全新的手段……\n一定能够，传达给更多的人。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_c:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fe5d12b5aa4fd91267d4cd18fbca71b550ed92012e79fb37fd7fdc250962c1f2",
      "text": "能够增加热爱大海的同志……！\n我是这么想的，才参加了这场试镜。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_c:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:39bc72d7b62e8bd037be7dad191cd3120697da7eaa800913c10bf9cee0734717",
      "text": "（多么富有热情啊。\n畅谈喜爱之物的他，真是充满魅力！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_c:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ff575e9739cfb29427a4dc8a8fd0208761796fc572204d2a6b6cfa7458b6bdcb",
      "text": "非常感谢！\n那么接下来，请北村想乐先生开始。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_c:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:afca05880b5bb45901bd672abe21483fffa9028ed3727709bdbb934bbefb7c4b",
      "text": "我是北村想乐。\n一边上大学，一边在杂货店当兼职店员～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_c:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d47b268ab6a2656d2f3705282d4db65eba02ae0e7a9eb01b06b32e37e7ad1d38",
      "text": "请问您对这个世界产生兴趣的理由是什么呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_c:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:55bb2513e68d992a43c33cdf9851aa4f9b67f55e15a7f6f01d773c8534055316",
      "text": "（……这种问题，像那个人那样\n热情洋溢地回答好像更能博得好感呢～……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_c:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d7508c3af5a8f7173633ad7b3f54839ffbf05980882268af40add1bec1dffb47",
      "text": "（但我，是为了展现真实的自己、\n想要自由地生活才来这里的呢～）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_d:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:86a51634775f75fb426f34c9ca8d026a4eb2125307f109c342cf6e50a0536289",
      "text": "我哥哥因为工作关系，会接触到演艺圈的人～\n在听哥哥聊那些事情的过程中……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_d:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:175fd2424a8335b0b3c5251ec662a809b61cad5bfc407dc92cbb1d4c71ad8aa1",
      "text": "对能接纳各种个性的、\n偶像的世界产生了兴趣～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_d:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ee3db4dc8e8cfa4f919ec43a8f3bdcdcf296dee9968ac33329be1f967010e62f",
      "text": "不伪装自己，自由自在地表现，\n同时赚取生活所需的金钱……这种事，",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_d:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a3fba26bc0e39c7f80ddb86b5c160106acdf2e3fceb712b4a7749ac24e47d5eb",
      "text": "在普通的社会里，是很困难的事情呢～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_d:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9a9aa910d5f51281c602b8cead5e6de893673ed73e3282f1d90827f33c4fce24",
      "text": "（不仅有现实的想法，\n还能感受到想要开拓未来的坚强意志……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_d:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dcfb8a546663e4942dc8c5ca50189fb5417643d68a8c0322c71eabba4d55a490",
      "text": "（他一定也，能够吸引很多人！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_d:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b079068c76516032c6ac3c3f41250e24ee60da28164ee702cf0db906b2f3e2be",
      "text": "虽然类型不同，\n但两位都是很有个性的人呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_d:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b8727bd0a4e0798c198f439890e9d8af91f93df4f9dd27b9a004f1c99177aca4",
      "text": "是的！两位都合格了。\n重新把两位叫进来，宣布结果吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_d:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3851724537edc005fc50f3a58e08ccc9e23bd6dd4d2329b2e02922697348a2e2",
      "text": "（说到个性……\n那位男性也散发着独特的气场呢）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_d:cmd-000093:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:df9f4a9fd7055909c250b5454d6dfd2406696acaa64ac3b7187daeaab9e8466b",
      "text": "啊，多谢了。要是有兴趣的话吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_d:cmd-000097:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7e61328d616a1d306399e27a9cfc2a109b5fe608155ea24fe44743796fd2eb10",
      "text": "我接下来要回去工作了，\n你也路上小心回去吧。再见啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_e:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:652ceb7650af9856d683d9d31ba94e86c4bb5f92da4302ef6b69fe6f623fd6b3",
      "text": "今天长时间辛苦大家了。\n关于试镜的结果，两位都合格了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_e:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f1a5e9b466d4d66b0d660e18186c3a8f3db1e45874a0de7f7fc87f4397118566",
      "text": "真的吗！太好了……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_e:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e66eadbdda889b2f9ff6511d39758bb1865121ebc90b27c3256562d9a7ef7efe",
      "text": "非常感谢～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_e:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6f5e62f71fae711a4b861cec14e3b03ec403b94e24df1e852d13ccdf9d566c19",
      "text": "从今往后我们就在同一个职场工作了呢。\n请多多关照。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_e:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1dcfc8da63a1154932c822511b4f28a51d875b30aebfd44c4ce0a73dbf1bd844",
      "text": "呵呵，是呢～。既然要长期相处，\n相处时就可以免去麻烦的客套和场面话了吧～？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_e:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:502ded5298150c9ca9ef3f10f9ae389dcca2c675e58612df1784f96f2c0808e6",
      "text": "是啊！我也希望能这样呢。\n见人说人话见鬼说鬼话什么的，我本就不擅长。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_e:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3628c94634fb608e832b24ff1af3a1e3cbffcad21d3db7f063ab95f1a00cb5ae",
      "text": "话说回来，能赶上试镜真是太好了。\n要是从那栋楼前走过的话，可就危险了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_e:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:349ece5bb826efa30da7a1d1acf842e987bd76bc55800c9697dbd43aef1262f2",
      "text": "咦，那栋楼是……\n难道说，是指有电视台进驻的那栋大楼～？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_e:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0b9e258b078077e2201a84ad9f4d1147a57bf5ca2215848f833eeb74c99c5741",
      "text": "是的。莫非，\n您也打算走那条路吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_e:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:53c8106395c795cf7a21e12f1ebc0c1726b941bd46d9e7f682a079bb04d8e1c3",
      "text": "嗯，克里斯先生也是啊～\n我们都没被卷进那起事故真是太好了呢～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_e:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5956c7872a60351b37dd953d0c750100fbeb76d251404af0e4b686e0f4d5b4ab",
      "text": "在来这里的路上，发生了什么事吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_f:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5c611dd91d7ba699f3e1e8b6e94ee1452756f51f6f35d08a9f32c1128cf44b58",
      "text": "来试镜的路上，\n本来打算从某栋楼前路过～……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_f:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1f12aac08041736d9fa3714cffc0ff88349a475f2ae06543c78c756f537e1a71",
      "text": "结果那里的一个男人对我说“最好别去”，\n我就绕了别的路呢～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_f:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e39118e01502f75479c8e67eab9e751d7464682c12f9f73ff9f16a7689aba415",
      "text": "我也遇到了同样的事，于是绕了道。\n然后，到了这里之后才听说……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_f:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:da0d9dbb929c63e1dc8ee4016e40b7d0d9a15a3dce163438f23cdcb5e8fc8a75",
      "text": "在我绕道的时候，一辆卡车冲上了那条路的人行道，\n发生了货物散落一地的事故。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_f:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e4ce0a0d1a9e92d35b5ede1b77fc72399646b77699c297901bfc08ffd268fd7e",
      "text": "网络新闻都报道了呢～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_f:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3d0ece940fbcbf524b6cf93495d1159e62fa2cc7ea2b7f04284ab26f6cd1724f",
      "text": "要是走了那条路的话，\n可能就赶不上试镜了呢～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_f:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:67ba3bbc2c5bd6ec893e8310e0054842ccf527f6f05b437b70eaa7145c52a0e5",
      "text": "居然有这种事……\n两位都没事，真是太好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_f:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9545b371e1b729f5424e6e07349f83ee54f90f9983475b4fb4722145ab859d61",
      "text": "听说包括我们在内，没有一个人受伤哦。\n想必是多亏了那位男性的提醒吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_f:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b95cd175440a88cd29f270404df268c7c928c79d5a136ca6e2ee377878e98a34",
      "text": "真是个奇妙的人呢～\n难道说，他早就知道会发生事故了吗～？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_f:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1e9afa631be222ca76a0c2e91a22e40e8bbb51695a3711012b39b0a4740c08fb",
      "text": "那位男性，长什么样子？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_f:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fefd055a3ab44aa7d24d9adf9cf5b6fa2e8476e2d4f6f510dbf5ba7247bfc52f",
      "text": "是个高个子的男人哦～\n而且，打扮得好像保洁人员的样子呢～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_f:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:81e291b6190ab9585b61b8b79e16f0a19c3e1b828c60b178d86b833ee68b9694",
      "text": "（……！一定，就是那个人）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_g:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:41eac2f77389c9d6cfbe2fa7dc16bdd8ff8371f0cb83f23d926d7c4234f79992",
      "text": "那个人，可能是我之前递了名片\n并邀请过的那位。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_g:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d0f07f98b6ee2a60a974c4f1ea4fe29ca97cf8485aacc52de8e9dd8af8d57088",
      "text": "贤君。不好意思，\n接下来的事情可以拜托你吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_g:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6a39c9e7a8335a4002cd6c200c6274ca1fb7b4e18b3f23dbf09b621f0e259bb5",
      "text": "我想再去见一次那位男性！\n所以，这两位就……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_g:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ea0a5d4325086d468fa8005c5e943dff4fa5ffe5ffac84985becc741ec80485a",
      "text": "那个，我也能跟着一起去吗～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_g:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:545d26ac4b364ee603fc4a330b1653fde8073a02aa8a38c50c6c400f985300f3",
      "text": "说不定，我也要和那个人\n一起共事了呢～？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_g:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ee0f65c10309524e9c90db855c64527fe027940e9bc8edc14e36ab647352b83b",
      "text": "既然这样，我也想了解下对方是个什么样的人呢～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_g:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fa1d27031d7f5a01728c9fc5236140ea75f0d73ef3e63261a1e556cbb7ecb3e8",
      "text": "正如想乐所言。\n制作人，请务必也让我同行！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_g:cmd-000086:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7019e65b1177d2c78ec1ac61b20f4387e17f08cdaf4501a71b6aa0ba7d53cc8e",
      "text": "……哎呀哎呀，总算收拾完了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_g:cmd-000105:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d9b818b1b60bfdab5364847ca3b2e8753185e27cc43695e42d83364b69190e50",
      "text": "是的。请问您对偶像的工作有兴趣吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_g:cmd-000108:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:796a7a888e8e9a7bcba202c87d290d6ebff1e2323d509d3624ddfd5a1423c2a9",
      "text": "我们近期要举办试镜。\n如果有兴趣的话，请务必来参加！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_g:cmd-000127:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ff001bb06246f375e4437b03008edf3d75b7c210c8569013be1eb8dd724e7f31",
      "text": "（本来打算参加今天的份的……\n这个时间的话，肯定已经结束了吧）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_g:cmd-000135:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e5ffae924d77bd95f5cb15a2d532b45c780e468b108110cf0aaaf7e183b83d56",
      "text": "（算了，半路上发现了污垢的话，\n那也是没办法的事。看来跟这家事务所无缘……嗯？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_g:cmd-000158:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d8cf599bdf7d06b5f3193fb633232b8bdaa34d12f74f5025558cfbf0fa1f84f0",
      "text": "你们几位是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_h:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:79ba86437b4f239e4f4bf1157ed42370dba2d276995bd109bea51f841eef2a89",
      "text": "刚才真是太感谢了。托您的福，\n想乐和我，犹如平鳍旗鱼畅游一般……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_h:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9b78226b78e5760fb57d42d8efa6ef4043c42c592db59eac7fa84fb82cfde267",
      "text": "我和这位克里斯先生，\n都赶上了315 Pro的试镜哦～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_h:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:16990c32d05a49ad2c61c8904ad82815dcb1e8e71a50a9d67b4f79ff5d083b28",
      "text": "……哈哈。你们也是这样啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_h:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a9cccd65d3d98ac70eddb67e73d8716820f389a4674249528c6605943b27d5e6",
      "text": "突然找上门来，真不好意思。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_h:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0472b76e749a4c1e6f4fd58ca3c17c6e93878442ed3fa12556c01586a6f15712",
      "text": "听说两位在来试镜的路上被您救了，所以……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_h:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8bc9f0dde6b8846a536431b1ee1e763a07eb8593c331066e10ec85ef51898671",
      "text": "那张名片，难道说，\n您有考虑过试镜的事吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_h:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5e87b95e25ca062daa6398a5bd74f01673114870f736059c302ce545f03d57a4",
      "text": "……啊。刚才正好在想呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_h:cmd-000086:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:799ef94367818246b68dddf531b005381ab5db5cb25572867e26824a11154660",
      "text": "（年龄和外貌都截然不同的这两人。我还以为，\n是去学校或者去上班的呢……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_h:cmd-000091:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:adb19b26deabac2e668734668d5a9711cdfb87774e6242ac462c6534a9392ea8",
      "text": "（没想到，居然跟我是一个目的地啊。……嗯。\n这么一看，还真是个性十足的阵容啊）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_h:cmd-000095:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:29699be921db59b54a9bb8e52f45334238c1df48e805d38106fd819707a7e0e1",
      "text": "（看来这里，会有场愉快的邂逅啊）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_h:cmd-000114:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e444f06bb6b5bc0a0397acfe8b06dfb68adc951179e60f8085dfc3624fe50cb5",
      "text": "如果可以的话，现在来参加试镜\n如何呢？对了，您的名字是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_h:cmd-000116:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:70a73499855d498f755ee19a8f04b63eb92a834b0bf6e4074ee66102b9ea69fd",
      "text": "还没报上名字呢。我是葛之叶雨彦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_h:cmd-000121:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eaf7bb1f3c877afb262db327a1795bf51c54642c835fcfa68e265f2bc2dbf6ab",
      "text": "既然你觉得可以的话，\n那这个机会……我就心怀感激地收下了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_i:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d0052abe86ffafe275a3b4581012d4803096e9a564037765bcf074c445a4e69c",
      "text": "我工作的公司叫“AYAKASHI清扫社”。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_i:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2dc3db75c62b950e3ca934289e4aeb99ea3e78d69d2f4537f43cc024fff5ad80",
      "text": "从企业到普通家庭，\n承接任何地方的除污工作。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_i:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f8729084513c6902abe8ad0574c76285421dd6483b85bc1301a27893e52c7a7b",
      "text": "之所以来参加试镜，\n是因为注意到了演艺圈这个地方的污垢啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_i:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:42bfa2000da192a2979dc3f7d6f1dc4e0a7da884c765fa763514dbfeebb52b35",
      "text": "当了偶像的话，就能出入各种各样的现场，\n打扫起来也会更容易吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_i:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3f9f42bc7f90f2db1c067ad71a6c2f64f38ac4714e7cc802969d569077153bef",
      "text": "当然，不止是打扫。既然被你选上了，\n我也会回应作为偶像的期待的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_i:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8f9ccb47d5c6f7b06b81bacf223a52a318dd279ac69dadc4dab7f9da25622e48",
      "text": "非常感谢！\n那么，接下来……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_i:cmd-000051:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "数日后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_i:cmd-000058:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5777408e80aee62e0fade05c1a890f46d8142140e4f81cf72055c88a30508d92",
      "text": "克里斯的家",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_i:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7e737a7f575e0e6fd9444e4c9558f826d5e7cf1b7be8adcb1ce5b0714b339626",
      "text": "打扰了～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_i:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f2f1d0d1f3f282308efb29b01cdbe67efb93c529532bf549712d247efc141b1d",
      "text": "古论，明明才刚认识，\n请我们进家里真的好吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_i:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:29ccfa729e669f979803572ec2835876212e81157341298361ef0392c0789c52",
      "text": "是的。家人都出门了，请不必客气。\n来，请坐这边。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_i:cmd-000111:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:36b62e854bf8699c221b46beb53264a7d3e596f2e1a89707deab3d1f51100a5a",
      "text": "再次祝贺大家全员合格。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_i:cmd-000114:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7477c8dd04e547702e7554336da3f22ce1fd498c064bc095723abe938d39d930",
      "text": "另外，能以这样的形式与各位聚在一起，\n我感到无比高兴。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_i:cmd-000118:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2cf9378c8d168a0e3d974eba77f79cf20487ec0f5d882d1cff40ed62b94b82f0",
      "text": "没想到，那天认识的三个人，\n居然会组成一个组合呢～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_i:cmd-000128:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:02687549df3b2e4d5266e0cbb1a34ac190dbb5d942145d212384c1631932505c",
      "text": "真的……雨彦、想乐。\n今后作为热爱大海的同志，一起加油吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_i:cmd-000136:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fdd46af253eaa4b73bd2ae3b79e9398108e1caa6f0924d4e9f835865145276e2",
      "text": "……克里斯先生～虽然成了一个组合，\n但我可不记得成了那样的同志哦～？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_i:cmd-000140:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6b27734124a4064ef82ce60d10985d840ec33af7de62ddd4b8b640f4bdbdb913",
      "text": "怎会如此……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_j:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4ff00985297362559ca57feb0fea016034f3eedd05d140b8717fcdaaff6e1919",
      "text": "话说回来，刚才开始飘过来的这股海潮香气是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_j:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:96b6ac272dbe807e47ae9f48e3e0a12b1148ac2cedaf838d3d12a153b43f0072",
      "text": "您注意到了吗！\n为了今天，我从昨晚就开始准备的料理。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_j:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8749e8c1bd604b82d8629fa981e019b2c31928a5c17a12c5e44172d0364b2f01",
      "text": "地中海风味西班牙海鲜饭、西式炖鲷鱼。\n蒜香油浸峨螺，还有鲣鱼卡尔帕乔。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_j:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0ca29a7c5ebc0e9950a4704725b016af120da6d4e4ce01794288bd5fbcef9361",
      "text": "顺便一提，峨螺的唾液腺中，虽然有时会含有名为四甲铵的\n毒素……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_j:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bb85bcf3f954d2205f054caf695b0b0d980251de6fa87dfd6eec7ecd9e021e50",
      "text": "但内脏已经全部去除干净了，请放心。\n请尽情享受海鲜的魅力吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_j:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:09f15af2eaad36b6be4760f567c536e8972c770caf2b4b7254ec67ae11778576",
      "text": "之前我就挺在意的，\n你可真是非同一般地热爱大海啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_j:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:34a999841f45dcdc020b2182137b72cfa87fe2ab8a1d25b820e4369d9859ee11",
      "text": "是的！我是为了传达大海的魅力，\n才立志走上偶像之路的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_j:cmd-000091:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bb9746e8a99697c633f4389da30909257f7084fbf761c69aa18fefd0cb7df660",
      "text": "顺便说一句，我呢，是为了顺从本心，\n赚取每日的口粮哦～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_j:cmd-000099:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b736116406889cab4705871231148810029bcc07b6d7f9c5e3276f9973c13436",
      "text": "而我，则是为了清扫演艺圈的污垢……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_j:cmd-000119:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:39aba47f420547d6ee42dafae9a66a647f18b0c432b1224e4110e42ae6ca9aa8",
      "text": "各自的目标全然不同，真是一群有趣的家伙。\n我们三个人的话，今后看起来不会无聊了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_j:cmd-000126:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1f0143873fa3750f4ebef8a4d63fdc93748020e9b6a1095466c69bd478aa2899",
      "text": "乐在其中固然好，可也别忘了这是工作哦～\n在这个圈子里被埋没、进退维谷什么的，我可敬谢不敏～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_j:cmd-000134:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1b5252e34a5e21beaa222a5e3f181aa9b4295c331559af7a487e86ad9df159be",
      "text": "那是自然。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_j:cmd-000147:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2ea83f329d94bcfa6aaed5f24be820436f760e16b0d0a6856a2950552254e861",
      "text": "异彩各缤纷，共赴同一路。\n某种意义上，感觉会成为一个默契十足的组合呢～？",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
